# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pack Pucks — .gitignore
#
# Branch policy (see CLAUDE.md): `main` is PUBLIC, `private` is local-only.
# Entries below that name private docs are a SAFETY NET for `main` — they do
# not affect those files on `private`, where they are already tracked
# (.gitignore never applies to already-tracked files).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Private documents: must never reach the public `main` branch -----------
docs/State.md
docs/FIRMWARE_PLAN.md
docs/Methodology.md
docs/guardrails.md
docs/research_strategy.md
docs/open_decisions.md
docs/Observations.md
docs/FIELD_SOP.md
paper/
CLAUDE.md
firmware/CLAUDE.md
CODE_REVIEW.md

# --- Third-party literature -------------------------------------------------
# Copyrighted publisher PDFs (IEEE / Elsevier / arXiv). Kept locally for
# refs.bib verification; never redistributed from this repository.
docs/*.pdf

# --- Raw offload staging ----------------------------------------------------
# Working directory for tools/offload/offload.py. Curated, published datasets
# are copied into data/ranging_experiments/<session>/ instead.
tools/offload/offload/

# --- Build artefacts --------------------------------------------------------
build/
*.elf
*.bin
__pycache__/
venv/

# --- Editor / OS ------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

tools/offload/field_notes/
